  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the integration of culture into the the national strategic planning and UNSDCF to harness culture and measure its contribution to SDGs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention supports the measurement and monitoring of the contribution of culture to the achievement of the 2030 Agenda at the national and regional levels through the UNESCO Culture|2030 Indicators for promoting informed policymaking. Collaborate with Connect for Culture Africa Project in the advocacy for the implementation of the Assembly Decision AU/Dec.772 on the allocation of 1% of national budgets to the arts, culture heritage and creative industries sectors by 2030. Support AU in the implementation of culture conventions and the recommendations associated with them for regional cooperation platform and support Member States in translating their provisions into national policies and strategies in order to contribute to the implementation of the 2030 Agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
